1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Topping off the same tire every week?

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
That's a leak.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Losing a pound a month is normal.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Weekly top-offs can point to a leak.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
Usually it's a nail,

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,000
a cracked valve stem, or corrosion at the rim.

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Soapy water finds all three—

8
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:18,000
bubbles mark the spot. Do not guess.

9
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Stop by and we'll take a look.

10
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:24,000
